{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/aquilegia-arabtec-damac-hills-2","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":402,"crm_id":"1481","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Aquilegia","slug":"aquilegia-arabtec-damac-hills-2","display_address":"Damac Hills 2","building_type":["villa"],"completion_year":"Ready","developer":"Damac Properties","price":1600000,"display_price":"1.6M","lattitude":24.9928481,"longitude":55.3854732,"min_bedrooms":3,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Aquilegia is a residential community located in the Damac Hills 2 neighbourhood. The development consists exclusively of <strong>three-bedroom</strong> villas. The developer of the buildings is Arabtec Construction. Aquilegia villas are equipped with terraces, BBQ area, private Jacuzzi, children's play area, golf course and rooftop facilities.</p><p>The complex is equipped with 24-hour CCTV and a centralised cooling system. There are also 2 car parking spaces per villa. Aquilegia (Damac Hills 2) has a fishing lake, boating lake, butterfly garden, cricket pitch, football pitch, floating cinema, giant chess, jogging tracks, artificial beach, paddle tennis court, picnic park, snack bar, volleyball court;</p><p>Aquapark, amphitheatre, open-air cinema, outdoor gym, bicycle paths, swimming pools.</p><p>In 25 minutes by car you can get to a large shopping centre Mall of the Emirates, which is located: shops of world brands, popular indoor skiing complex Ski Dubai, cinema Vox Cinemas, restaurants and cafes P.F. Chang's, L'Erie. Chang's, L'ETO, More Cafe.</p><p>The Damac Hills 2 neighbourhood has kindergartens and schools, which can be reached within an average 30-minute drive.</p><p>Anaya, Ace and Aster clinics are all within a 30-minute drive. They offer residents of the neighbourhood a full package of medical services. Al Maktoum International Airport is 45 minutes away and Dubai International Airport is 40 minutes away.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1481/images/2024/03/20/kbrkeNygCTi0ToTBrrRGczEYuUplN4GNzyAR7uAN.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/03/20/kbrkeNygCTi0ToTBrrRGczEYuUplN4GNzyAR7uAN.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1481/images/2024/03/20/SgMwBL9ItliHdDKewQTbutGzE9xQAROJ5i6UrMTq.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/03/20/SgMwBL9ItliHdDKewQTbutGzE9xQAROJ5i6UrMTq.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1481/images/2024/03/20/qoHf62t3XhL5do1L6U5NJTCLT39YZxJiOISlC9Kq.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/03/20/qoHf62t3XhL5do1L6U5NJTCLT39YZxJiOISlC9Kq.png","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2147,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1395,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1361,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"1,529 ft²","media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"TBA ","payment_plans":[],"community":"Damac Hills 2","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":12015,"url":null,"text":"Covered Parking","type":null,"image":null},{"id":12016,"url":null,"text":"Security and CCTV","type":null,"image":null},{"id":12017,"url":null,"text":"Children’s pool","type":null,"image":null},{"id":12018,"url":null,"text":"Shared Pool","type":null,"image":null},{"id":12019,"url":null,"text":"Shared SPA","type":null,"image":null},{"id":12020,"url":null,"text":"Kids Play Area","type":null,"image":null},{"id":12021,"url":null,"text":"Central A/C","type":null,"image":null},{"id":12022,"url":null,"text":"Leisure areas","type":null,"image":null},{"id":12023,"url":